title: Memory Steward Phase B — dry-run on real curated data caught unsafe autonomous demotion
summary: 'Built Phase B (B1 CLAUDE.md source redirect + B2 `paradigm memory sync`). The pivotal moment: dry-running the first sync build against a COPY of the real 18KB hand-curated MEMORY.md revealed it would demote the user''s active, load-bearing sections — including the section literally marked "⭐ ACTIVE ARC START HERE" and "Release & Versioning Conventions" — and net-ADD 3KB via an over-eager projection. Unit tests (on synthetic fixtures) were all green and missed this entirely. Founder chose to rework B2 to advisory + strict guards.'
symbols_touched:
  - '#memory-steward-sync'
  - '#memory-cli'
  - '#claude-adapter'
